    "authors": ["John", "Claude"],
    "open_questions": [
      "The article dates his leaving \"the early 1990s\"; 1993 is a placeholder.",
      "The 1971-73 records (Osibisa, Woyaya, Heads) and The Coffee Song have no drum transcription, and his kit cannot be told from the band's hand drums by measuring the records: not scored. Music for Gong Gong and Ayiko Bia are the ones to transcribe first.",
      "The make of the black pearl kit on Beat-Club (1971) is not named in any source read.",
      "Who played what on the percussion overdubs: the albums credit him with bongos, bells and congas as well as drums, beside Kofi Ayivor and the horn players' percussion."
    ]
  },
